    "text": "The mass of $_{7} \\mathrm{~N}^{15}$ is $15.00011 \\mathrm{amu}$, mass of $_{8} \\mathrm{O}^{16}$ is 15.99492 amu and $m_{p}=1.00783$ amu. Determine binding energy of last proton of ${ }_{8} \\mathrm{O}^{16}$.",
