  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{M}\\left({ }_{8} \\mathrm{O}^{16}\\right)=\\mathrm{M}\\left({ }_{7} \\mathrm{~N}^{15}\\right)+1 \\mathrm{~m}_{\\mathrm{p}}$\r\n\r\nbinding energy of last proton $=M\\left(N^{15}\\right)+m_{P}-M\\left({ }_{1} O^{16}\\right)$\r\n\r\n$=15.00011+1.00783-15.99492$\r\n\r\n$=0.01302 \\mathrm{amu}=12.13 \\mathrm{MeV}$",
